-- THE MISSING TRADES JOIN THE TAXONOMY, UNDER TWELVE GROUPS. Seat: sales_engineer. 23 Sep 2026.
-- Founder instructions 895 / 899 / 900: "Don't assume 42 trades means we're fine. We are missing trades"
-- — first find and ADD the missing trades, then knowledge is built for the complete list. Everything
-- except food & beverage. Standing rules kept: exact trade match or none; categories open; a service
-- counts only when the supplier ticked it (857/862); no word matching.
--
-- MEASURED (production htdblwldjkcgjvmqkbeh, read-only, 23 Sep 2026): taxonomy_trade 42 active codes,
-- taxonomy_trade_service 211 rows; no parent group, no classification-code mapping anywhere. The research
-- (scratchpad kb/taxonomy_expansion.json + kb/gap_trades.json, sources cited per trade in
-- taxonomy_trade_code.source_urls) mapped what UAE businesses buy against the ISIC Rev.4 classes the UAE
-- activity codes extend (UN ISIC Rev.4 structure; SCAD ISIC4 table; Abu Dhabi DED trader activity list
-- 2020) and UNSPSC segments/families: 153 trades were missing, among them every kind of packaging,
-- industrial machinery and parts, pumps, valves, furniture, kitchen/laundry equipment, medical and lab,
-- uniforms, stationery, events, printing, legal/PRO, accounting, insurance, recruitment, fleet, fuel,
-- waste, testing and inspection, aircraft parts & MRO, ship repair, leather & footwear, bitumen, device
-- repair, event performers, railway, musical instruments, furniture repair, investigation.
--
-- WHAT THIS CHANGES
--   1. taxonomy_trade_group: twelve parent groups (EN + AR). taxonomy_trade.group_code: every trade, the
--      42 that existed included, names its group. Presentation and knowledge routing only.
--   2. 153 new trades (EN + AR, reviewed), 741 services beneath them (EN + AR, reviewed). 195 trades in all.
--      A new trade's aliases are its own two names, nothing else, and every new code has at least two
--      words: fn_norm_trades also reads the bare code, word-start, so a one-word code such as 'pumps' or
--      'training' would have claimed any text that uses the word (review of #881). Exact trade or none;
--      no word lists were invented for them. The verdict below asserts it on a mixed HVAC sentence.
--   3. SPLITS NEVER BREAK EXISTING DATA. Where a new trade is a specific part of an existing one (e.g.
--      corrugated_packaging of packaging), the old code stays active and unchanged as the umbrella;
--      taxonomy_trade.umbrella_code records the relation (52 rows). No supplier's trades, ticks or
--      exclusions and no inquiry are rewritten: a supplier of packaging keeps receiving every inquiry
--      that names packaging, and is not sent corrugated_packaging inquiries until HE adds that trade.
--      The Services tab offers the specific trades beside the umbrella, unticked (supplier_services.ts,
--      source 'refine'); a specific trade joins his trades only when he ticks one of its services.
--   4. What the research marked a MERGE (labels, strapping and sacks, lighting, IT hardware, cloud,
--      duct cleaning, interior plants, locksmith and film, yacht services) is 23 services added under
--      the existing trade, not a trade of its own; a service an existing trade already names was dropped.
--   5. taxonomy_trade_code: 385 classification codes (isic4 / uae_activity / unspsc) with the URLs they
--      were read from. Only codes a fetched source showed; none invented.
--
-- NOT CHANGED: fn_match_capability, fn_norm_trades, fn_taxonomy_trades_for, fn_services_effective,
-- service_implication, any supplier_capabilities row, any inquiry. Food & beverage is not added.
-- field_definition / field_definition_trade are NOT used: their FK is mep_trade (hvac, electrical,
-- plumbing, fire, elv) and the quote hold does not read them. "Exact specs or the quote is held" is the
-- line_specs catalogue (supabase/functions/_shared/line_specs/model.ts): the new trades whose lines are
-- products named by make and model are held there on brand + model (spec trade branded_goods, same PR);
-- pest_control, tents_shades and fencing_shades read as the existing pestcontrol / shade spec trades;
-- every other new trade is held on the quote-level terms every quote carries (delivery / lead time) and
-- has no line-level spec yet — made-to-order goods and services need their own readers, per trade.
--
-- Committed, not applied: scripts/sql/pending/<this file>.txt. The release operator applies it:
--   node scripts/apply_sql.mjs scripts/sql/the_missing_trades_join_the_taxonomy_under_twelve_groups.sql --apply --ddl --seat sales_engineer
-- then deletes the pending note and appends this file to the END of MANIFEST.txt. Idempotent: every
-- insert is on conflict, every alter is if-not-exists. PROBE: the last statement returns one verdict row.

-- 24 SEP 2026 (sales_engineer, same subject, so this file and not a second one): 18 more trades, 195 -> 213.
-- MEASURED: demolition, general contracting, masonry, swimming pools, marble & stone, insulation, curtains &
-- blinds, facilities management, home/office removals and architectural/interior design existed only as a
-- SERVICE under a neighbour (civil_works, landscaping, flooring, waterproofing, upholstery, cleaning,
-- logistics_moving, interior_fitout), and the intake words for them resolved to that neighbour; lighting
-- fixtures were a service of electrical; packaging "in all its kinds" (founder, 895) lacked labels & sleeves,
-- protective, woven sacks / FIBC, luxury boxes, paper bags, pharma packaging and tapes & strapping as trades
-- (they were services under packaging). Each is added the same way as the 153: own two names as aliases, a
-- group, EN + AR services, umbrella_code = the trade it was a service of (the old services stay, nothing is
-- remapped). The intake words are repointed in an_intake_trade_word_names_its_own_trade_never_a_neighbour.sql.

-- 1. THE TWELVE PARENT GROUPS ----------------------------------------------------------------------
create table if not exists public.taxonomy_trade_group (
  code     text primary key check (code ~ '^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$'),
  label_en text not null check (btrim(label_en) <> ''),
  label_ar text not null check (label_ar ~ '[ء-ي]'),
  sort     integer not null default 100
);
comment on table public.taxonomy_trade_group is
  'The twelve parent groups every taxonomy_trade belongs to (presentation and knowledge routing only; matching never reads a group). Seat: sales_engineer. Founder instructions 895/899/900, 23 Sep 2026.';
alter table public.taxonomy_trade_group enable row level security;
drop policy if exists taxonomy_trade_group_service_role_only on public.taxonomy_trade_group;
create policy taxonomy_trade_group_service_role_only on public.taxonomy_trade_group
  as permissive for all to public using (false) with check (false);
revoke all on public.taxonomy_trade_group from anon, authenticated;

on conflict (code) do update set label_en = excluded.label_en, label_ar = excluded.label_ar, sort = excluded.sort;

-- 2. EVERY TRADE NAMES ITS GROUP, AND A SPECIFIC TRADE NAMES THE UMBRELLA IT WAS SPLIT FROM -----------
alter table public.taxonomy_trade add column if not exists group_code text
  references public.taxonomy_trade_group(code) on update cascade;
alter table public.taxonomy_trade add column if not exists umbrella_code text
  references public.taxonomy_trade(code) on update cascade;
do $$ begin
  if not exists (select 1 from pg_constraint where conname = 'taxonomy_trade_umbrella_is_another_trade') then
    alter table public.taxonomy_trade add constraint taxonomy_trade_umbrella_is_another_trade check (umbrella_code is distinct from code);
  end if;
end $$;
comment on column public.taxonomy_trade.group_code is
  'Parent group (taxonomy_trade_group). Presentation and knowledge routing only: fn_match_capability never reads it.';
comment on column public.taxonomy_trade.umbrella_code is
  'The broader trade this specific trade was split from. The umbrella stays a valid trade: suppliers who hold it keep it and every inquiry naming it still reaches them. Nobody is moved to the specific trade: the Services tab offers it, unticked, beside the umbrella (supplier_services.ts preparedTrades, source refine) and it joins his trades only when he ticks one of its services. Matching never reads this column.';

